{"id":"17e23d087321028e","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties.md","title":"Properties of Kleene Ordinal Notations","display":"lem-ordinal-notation-properties — Properties of Kleene Ordinal Notations","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties","aliases":["88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties"],"display":"lem-ordinal-notation-properties — Properties of Kleene Ordinal Notations","depends_on":["[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","[[88-df-recursive-ordinal]]","[[88-df-omega-ck-1]]","[[88-thm-kleene-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ordinal-notation-properties — Properties of Kleene Ordinal Notations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8235ab063b382f0f\" href=\"?note=8235ab063b382f0f\" title=\"88-df-recursive-ordinal\">88-df-recursive-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"70c9b5b34dbebb64\" href=\"?note=70c9b5b34dbebb64\" title=\"88-df-omega-ck-1\">88-df-omega-ck-1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75e301ab0a784049\" href=\"?note=75e301ab0a784049\" title=\"88-thm-kleene-recursion\">88-thm-kleene-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88},&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}},P_a,|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\omega_1\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88},&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}},P_a,|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\omega_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a>，并采用该文件的固定标准可接受编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecOrd}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8235ab063b382f0f\" href=\"?note=8235ab063b382f0f\" title=\"88-df-recursive-ordinal\">88-df-recursive-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"70c9b5b34dbebb64\" href=\"?note=70c9b5b34dbebb64\" title=\"88-df-omega-ck-1\">88-df-omega-ck-1</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1\">\\(\\alpha+1\\)</span> 与上确界为标准序数运算。</li>\n<li>有效记号表示的递归构造使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75e301ab0a784049\" href=\"?note=75e301ab0a784049\" title=\"88-thm-kleene-recursion\">88-thm-kleene-recursion</a>；这不是定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span> 时额外假定的范围等式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}:\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\\omega_1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n(a&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}b\\to|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\in|b|_{\\mathcal O_{88}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}:\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\\omega_1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n(a&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}b\\to|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\in|b|_{\\mathcal O_{88}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;0\\notin\\mathcal O_{88},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\\Bigl(\na=1\\lor\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;a=2^b\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\na=3\\cdot5^e\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq\\mathcal O_{88}\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\varphi_e(k)&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\varphi_e(k+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;0\\notin\\mathcal O_{88},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\\Bigl(\na=1\\lor\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;a=2^b\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\na=3\\cdot5^e\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq\\mathcal O_{88}\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\varphi_e(k)&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\varphi_e(k+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;|1|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n|2^a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}+1,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\n|3\\cdot5^e|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\sup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}|\\varphi_e(k)|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\Bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\{|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}:a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\}\n=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{RecOrd}(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\sup_{a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}}|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;|1|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n|2^a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}+1,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\n|3\\cdot5^e|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\sup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}|\\varphi_e(k)|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\Bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\{|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}:a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\}\n=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{RecOrd}(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\sup_{a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}}|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明要点。按正生成规则作超限闭包归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的前驱集为空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^a\">\\(2^a\\)</span> 的前驱良序是在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a\">\\(P_a\\)</span> 后添加末元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>；极限记号的前驱集是递增链 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\varphi_e(k)}\\cup\\{\\varphi_e(k)\\}\">\\(P_{\\varphi_e(k)}\\cup\\{\\varphi_e(k)\\}\\)</span> 的并。链上的前驱关系彼此相容，因此所得仍是一个可数良序，其序型分别满足三个显示的子句。这也给出构造子的逆向分析以及严格的秩下降；不能用未经证明的全局序数值比较替代此归纳。</p>\n<p>每个有效记号的前驱集及其顺序均可枚举，且在其载集上为线性序。通过无重复枚举重编可枚举载集，并对两个方向的顺序枚举作并行搜索，可取得可判定的良序表示，因此其值是递归序数。反向是 Kleene 记号表示定理：对可判定良序的递归下降树，通过有效递归取得覆盖其高度的有效记号；记号值的初段由前驱记号给出，从而每个递归序型本身也被表示。这里不主张可以从任意输入的良序程序判定其良序性，或统一求出其精确序型。</p>\n<p>这部分对应 K. Tanaka《Logic and Computation II: Recursion-theoretic hierarchies》的 Kleene 记号表示结果。最后一行由值域等式和 Church–Kleene 序数的上确界定义推出。所有这些是关于已定义最小系统的引理，不是该系统的附加定义公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"8235ab063b382f0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursive-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-omega-ck-1","status":"resolved","id":"70c9b5b34dbebb64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-omega-ck-1]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-kleene-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"75e301ab0a784049","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-kleene-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_{88},<_{\\mathcal O_{88}},P_a,|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\omega_1$ 见 [[88-df-ordinal-notation]]，并采用该文件的固定标准可接受编号 $\\varphi_e$。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"8235ab063b382f0f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecOrd}$ 见 [[88-df-recursive-ordinal]]；$\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}$ 见 [[88-df-omega-ck-1]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-omega-ck-1","status":"resolved","id":"70c9b5b34dbebb64","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecOrd}$ 见 [[88-df-recursive-ordinal]]；$\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}$ 见 [[88-df-omega-ck-1]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-kleene-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"75e301ab0a784049","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有效记号表示的递归构造使用 [[88-thm-kleene-recursion]]；这不是定义 $\\mathcal O_{88}$ 时额外假定的范围等式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{88},<_{\\mathcal O_{88}},P_a,|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}:\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\\omega_1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n(a<_{\\mathcal O_{88}}b\\to|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\in|b|_{\\mathcal O_{88}})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&0\\notin\\mathcal O_{88},\\\\\n&\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\\Bigl(\na=1\\lor\\exists b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;a=2^b\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\lor\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\na=3\\cdot5^e\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq\\mathcal O_{88}\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\varphi_e(k)<_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\varphi_e(k+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&|1|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=0,\\\\\n&\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n|2^a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}+1,\\\\\n&\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\n|3\\cdot5^e|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\sup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}|\\varphi_e(k)|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\Bigr),\\\\\n&\\{|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}:a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\}\n=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{RecOrd}(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n&\\sup_{a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}}|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"2^a","display":false},{"tex":"P_a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\varphi_e(k)}\\cup\\{\\varphi_e(k)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":3581,"backlinks":[{"id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"值图用严格前驱良序的序型定义，不以“值图已经是函数”为前提。其全定义性、生成子句和恰好表示所有递归序数，是 [[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]] 的内容，不再把表示定理偷放进一个所谓的闭包定义中。$\\omega_1$ 仅提供值图的集合论载体，与 $\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}$ 不是同一记号。"},{"id":"5e3111fd9385df4f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_{88},|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\varphi_e$ 见 [[88-df-ordinal-notation]]；良基秩和构造子分析见 [[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]。"},{"id":"c261b0ab1c6bf486","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_{88}$ 见 [[88-df-ordinal-notation]]，构造子性质见 [[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]；[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness.md]]\n[[88-lem-countable-syntax.md]]\n[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification.md]]\n[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence.md]]\n[[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization.md]]\n[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b23177f17eeaa7a2","8235ab063b382f0f","70c9b5b34dbebb64","75e301ab0a784049"]}